truetype/saucecodepro-nerd/
---------------------------

Project   https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts (the patch)
          https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-code-pro (the outlines)
Release   Nerd Fonts 3.5.1 over Source Code Pro 2.042, as the faces declare in
          their own name table: `fc-query -f '%{fontversion}' <face>` for the
          outlines, name IDs 3 and 5 for the patch version.
Archive   SourceCodePro.tar.xz
          sha256 50ead7bb7addce27cf4b55f4fffb669b5f1899fece675fad623a2a75a478c8c7
Faces     SauceCodeProNerdFont{,Mono}-{Regular,Bold,Italic,BoldItalic}.ttf
Family    SauceCodePro Nerd Font, SauceCodePro Nerd Font Mono
Licence   ../OFL.txt, one directory up, where it covers both families.

The archive also ships ExtraLight, Light, Medium, SemiBold and Black with their
italics, and a third variant, SauceCodePro Nerd Font Propo, whose icons are
proportionally spaced. Neither is shipped: the suite asks for natural-width
icons or one-cell icons, and Propo is neither.
